---
title: "Notice to {{placeholder: recipient}}"
document_type: unilateral_act
questions:
  recipient:
    type: text
    prompt: Full name of the addressee
  notice-period:
    type: duration
    prompt: Notice period
    default:
      value: 30
      unit: D
  schedule:
    type: boolean
    prompt: Attach the schedule of assets?
sides:
  - name: issuer
    label: Issuer
    parties:
      - name: acme
        type: legal_entity
        legal_name: Acme Corporation
  - name: addressees
    label: Addressee
    parties:
      - name: beta
        type: legal_entity
        legal_name: '{{placeholder: recipient}}'
language: en
attachments:
  - id: assets
    title: "Schedule 1: Assets"
    file: assets.pdf
    when: schedule
  - id: contacts
    title: "Schedule 2: Contacts"
    file: contacts.pdf
    when: "!schedule"
---

This notice is issued by {{party: acme}} to {{placeholder: recipient}} as addressee.

# Notice {#notice}

The notice period is {{placeholder: notice-period}}.

The assets listed in {{attach: assets}} are covered by this notice. {when=schedule}

The contacts listed in {{attach: contacts}} remain responsible for the assets. {when=!schedule}

Delivery is made {{choose: schedule, true="by courier *and* e-mail", false="by e-mail [only]"}}.

The notice takes effect immediately
{{choose: schedule, true=", subject to the schedule,", false=""}}
upon delivery.
